---
// The figure of the Snapshots and clones room: fs, its snapshots and one clone,
// each drawn as its ds_bp, a root block and four data blocks labelled with
// their birth txg, with their deadlists. The visitor queues changes and sync
// tasks in the open txg and syncs it; src/lib/snapshots.ts (a transcription of
// dsl_dataset_block_kill, dsl_deadlist_insert, the snapshot, clone and destroy
// sync functions) decides every outcome, and src/lib/snapshots-view.ts draws
// it, at build time for the opening state (readable without JavaScript) and in
// the browser after. Refs: ANALYSIS.md, room "Snapshots and clones";
// simplifications: DECISIONS.md D5.2. After each sync a line says what it did, the
// blocks it changed carry a ring, and blocks kept only for snapshots are hatched
// (D28.1).
import type { Lang } from "../lib/rooms";
